. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * 
. 
. * As seen from the described variables, our model aims to test whether having
>  daughters is more likely associated with left-wing way of voting behaviour *
. * The analysis is moderated by the control variables and the general interest
>  in politics. *
. * The dependent variable is binary, meaning that the model aims to test wheth
> er the respondents with daughters are more likely to vote for the selected le
> ft-wing parties or not. *
. 
. 
